<title>POLAND: Komunalny Q4 net falls to PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Komunalny Q4 net falls to PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Komunalny SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     3.09    vs   3.80</p>
